  "detail_text": "Hello Prospective Bidders, We thank you for the submission of your questions to get the more clarification on the subject requirement. We compiled all the received questions in one file and after carefully reviewing your question, our internal customer provided best possible answers to each question. Please find attached the file titled \"QA sheet-Question & Answer” , question highlighted in RED and answer highlighted in GREEN text for your ready reference and necessary action. Note: Please find attached revised designs for “Auto Advertising Campaign for Freedom 250” for your ready reference, We hope provided answers will help you to have comprehensive understanding of the requirement and allow you to submit proposal competitive and accurately. Bid Submission: Closing Date of Bid Submission Deadline : April 21, 2026, full day (Local India Time ) , which means all bids must be received by this deadline. No bid will be accepted after crossing the deadline. Submission Method: Please submit your bid thru email at newdelhibids@state.gov . Bid submitted any other email Id shall not be considered for evaluation. Read the Solicitation for complete details. Subject Line: “Solicitation-191N6526Q0035 for Auto Rikshaw Advertising Campaign”. Important Note : Do not submit bid via courier or by hand. Bid received at any other address or after the deadline shall be rejected and dealt with in accordance with FAR provision 52.215-1",
